0210: GPU profile without Tracy (AURORA_GPU_PROFILE=<seconds>)

The pass timestamp profiler (gpu_prof) also runs in builds without Tracy: AURORA_GPU_PROFILE=<s>
(default 5) requests TimestampQuery (+ allow_unsafe_apis for the encoder-level zones) and logs,
every <s> seconds, the GPU time per presented frame of every labelled pass and zone (grouped by
label without the trailing pass index, with the average count per frame), the busiest single
passes, the summed top-level busy time and its share of wall time. Passes that had no label
before are timed too: every enhanced-lighting pass (bloom, glow, beam, AO, masks, shadow-map
atlas, composite, mask copies, scene copy), the post-process chain (PostFx <n>) and the 6-bit
blend resolves (EFB blend6 copy / quantize). Up to 511 zones per frame (was 127). Nothing changes
without the variable.

